# UST.G3BK Correction-Pencil Operator Compiler Theorem

## Result

G3BI emits the exact root-containing start and G3BJ selects a smooth path to
the fixed B89 endpoint. G3BK compiles that specific deformation into the
already frozen eta9 residue/Macaulay language. It does not substitute a new
family or a proxy connection.

Write

```text
F_a = F_B89 + a C,
C   = F_G3BI - F_B89.
```

The correction `C` has 19 nonzero coefficients in `Q(gamma)`, all in the
`t0` lane. Eighteen remain nonzero at the good-reduction place
`(11,gamma-3)`. The complete pole-derivative source blocks are therefore

```text
H20 -> H11:  R_P = -3 P sC,   4,712 exact Q(gamma) entries,
H11 -> H02:  R_P = -4 P sC,  19,247 exact Q(gamma) entries.
H02 -> pole6: R_P = -5 P sC,   4,712 exact Q(gamma) entries.
```

Their canonical coefficient streams and reductions are emitted and replayed
independently.

## Exact H20 resolvent

In the frozen H20 augmented chart, only the `dPhi/ds` image column changes.
Consequently

```text
K_C = C0^-1 C1_C = x_C e_F0^T
```

has rank one. With

```text
N_C(gamma) = 3261 + 1627 gamma - 611 gamma^2
             - 3170 gamma^3 - 827 gamma^4 + 2917 gamma^5,

D(gamma)   = -335 + 547 gamma + 1304 gamma^2
             + 627 gamma^3 + 443 gamma^4 - 407 gamma^5,
```

the exact identities are

```text
alpha_C = N_C/D,
K_C^2   = alpha_C K_C,
det(C0+a C1_C)/det(C0) = (D+a N_C)/D.
```

The sole chart pole `a_*=-D/N_C` is algebraic. Every interior point of the
G3BJ arc

```text
a(t)=1-t+i*pi*t*(1-t)
```

is transcendental, so no interior point can meet this pole in any
Archimedean embedding. Both endpoints are units as well. At
`(11,gamma-3)`, `D=8`, `N_C=9`, and `D+N_C=6`, all nonzero in `GF(11)`.
Thus one H20 chart covers the entire selected path.

For H11 and H02, the determinant of each frozen affine chart is likewise a
nonzero polynomial in `a` over `Q(gamma)`, because its value at `a=0` is the
already certified B89 unit. Every chart pole is therefore algebraic. The
transcendental G3BJ interior avoids all of them automatically. Only the
initial endpoint `a=1` may need an H11/H02 initializer transition; no interior
chart subdivision is needed.

